# RESULT: client "session stopped (LOCAL NORMAL)", AudioTrack stop; server "media stopped" same second"

## CASE 6 rebind path (device)
# RESULT: NetworkCallback fired (network 217); Network.bindSocket -> EPERM (Operation not permitted) on this MIUI build; fallback teardown+backoff reconnect succeeded (design fallback)

## CASE 7 JNI findings (device)
# FINDING 1: JNI surface had never run on device: env: &mut JNIEnv signature broke every createSession call (jni 0.21 requires JNIEnv by value per crate docs) — fixed, all functions by-value
# FINDING 2: NetworkCallback bind hint (local address of active network) breaks VPN-overlay routing (tailscale): socket pinned to wlan0 cannot reach the tailnet address — noBindHint switch added; design note for migration
